flowchart TD
  Visitor([Visiteur]) -->|présente billet| Sensor[Capteur IoT\nGATE-EXPO-A1-001]
  Sensor -->|scan QR/RFID| StateMachine[Machine à États\nDeviceStateMachine]
  StateMachine -->|onReadSuccess| Validate[ValidateTicketUseCase]
  Validate -->|findById| TicketRepo[(TicketRepository\nin-memory)]
  Validate -->|résultat| Capacity[CheckVenueCapacityUseCase]
  Capacity -->|findById| VenueRepo[(VenueRepository\nin-memory)]
  Capacity -->|hasCapacity| RecordEntry[RecordEntryUseCase]
  RecordEntry -->|save| TicketRepo
  RecordEntry -->|save| VenueRepo
  RecordEntry -->|publish| MqttPub[MqttEventPublisher]
  MqttPub -->|MQTT message| Broker[[aedes Broker\nport 1883]]
  Broker -->|subscribe| Dashboard[Dashboard Web\nport 3000]
  Broker -->|subscribe| WS[WebSocket\nport 3001]
  WS -->|broadcast| Browser([Navigateur])
